    "id": "du_m_qcq",
    "name": "Iron of the King's River",
    "icon": "serbian_mining",
    "repeatable": false,
    "player_playstyle": "military",
    "chance": 5000,
    "notes": "Vejen is a land of bog iron, heath and hard men by the King's River. We have no coast, no vassals and no patience. Our lords are pious, our farmers obey, and every one of them can hold a spear. The rich towns around us will learn what iron is for.",
